From 59d29ff693e47635d1a6e6694840855f3e28a8e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 05:22:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] feat(registry): let the status subresource write
 endpoints

Accept "endpoints" in update_status. Each entry is validated as an
Endpoint before anything is written, because reading back a payload
that fails typed validation silently degrades it to a base resource,
and the list replaces status.endpoints as a whole. Like phase, it only
applies to resources with a status subtree.

Clients cannot set endpoints: the create endpoint ignores status, so
only the controller decides where the gateway may send traffic.
